# Where the shared iOS signing assets live: one Apple Distribution certificate
# and the App Store profiles for every signed target, stored encrypted in a
# private repo. Damian and Oskar both sign with this one certificate; nobody
# creates their own. Setup and rules: apps/mobile/README.md -> "iOS signing".
#
# The lanes in the Fastfile pass everything else (type, bundle IDs, team, API
# key), so there is one list of signed targets: IOS_SIGNED_TARGETS.
#
# Read-only by default, so nothing creates a certificate or profile by
# accident. Never run `fastlane match nuke`: it revokes every distribution
# certificate on the team.
#
# Never put credentials here (API key, passwords): fastlane prints every
# Matchfile value unmasked. fastlane/__tests__/signing-guards.test.ts
# enforces that.

git_url("https://github.com/ogigg/sweaty-signing.git")
git_branch("main")
storage_mode("git")
readonly(true)
